        },
        {
          "text": "Yarakēngērwa, agahurwa n’abantu; yar’ umunyamibabaro, yar’ azi intimba ic’ ari co; yakēngērwa nk’umuntu abandi bahisha mu maso habo, natwe nta co twamwibajijeko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.3",
