        {
          "text": "N’ukuri n’izacu ntimba yishizeko, n’iyacu mibabaro yikoreye; ariko tweho twamwiyumviriye nk’ uwakubiswe, nk’uwacumiswe n’ Imana, akicurikirizwa n’akabonge. ",
