        {
          "text": "Yaracuranguzwa, yamar’ akarendeka, ntiyakūrak’ umunwa; nk’ umwagazi w’intama ujanwa mw ibāgiro, canke nk’ukw intama itekerereza imbere y’abayikemura, ni kw atākūyek’ umunwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
