              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bāgeze kw ahambga hamwe n’abanyavyaha, asangira imva n’umutunzi mu gupfa kwiwe; nah’ ata kibi yakoze, kand’ ata guhemana kwari mu kanwa kiwe.",
          "type": "text",
