        {
          "text": "Ni co gituma nzomugabanganya umugabane n’ abahambaye, kand’ azogabura iminyago n’abanyenkomezi; kuko yasutse ubugingo bgiwe, akageza ku gupfa, agaharūranwa n’abanyabicumuro: yamar’ ubgiwe yishizekw icaha ca benshi, kand’ asabira abanyabicumuro.",
